  /// Macie generates automatically after you configure it to assume an IAM
  /// role. For a Macie administrator to retrieve sensitive data from an
  /// affected S3 object for a member account, the trust policy for the role
  /// in the member account must include an sts:ExternalId condition that
  /// requires this ID.
  pub external_id: Str? = None
  /// The access method that's used to retrieve sensitive data from affected
  /// S3 objects. Valid values are: ASSUME_ROLE, assume an IAM role that is in
  /// the affected Amazon Web Services account and delegates access to Amazon
  /// Macie (roleName); and, CALLER_CREDENTIALS, use the credentials of the
  /// IAM user who requests the sensitive data.
