  /// The name of the IAM role that is in the affected Amazon Web Services
  /// account and Amazon Macie is allowed to assume when retrieving sensitive
  /// data from affected S3 objects for the account. This value is null if the
  /// value for retrievalMode is CALLER_CREDENTIALS.
  pub role_name: Str? = None
}

